---
// /brick-choir/watch — the front door to watch mode. Type the four-letter code on a TV that is running Pickle Park or
// Rally (or its Brick Choir home room) and land in the stands at /brick-choir/watch/<CODE>. A Pages Function serves the
// Pickle Park page there in spectator mode (functions/brick-choir/watch/[code].ts); when the room turns out to be a Rally
// TV, the spectator hops to the Rally watcher (/brick-choir/rally?watch=CODE) by itself. ?room=CODE skips the form.
---
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
<title>Watch the match live · Brick Choir · PointCast</title>
<meta name="description" content="Watch a Pickle Park or Rally match on someone's living-room TV from your phone: take a seat in the bleachers, every hit plays a note, and the TV hears you cheer. Type the code on the TV.">
<meta property="og:title" content="Watch the match live">
<meta property="og:description" content="Pickleball on a living-room TV where every hit is a note. Type the code, take a seat in the bleachers, cheer.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://pointcast.xyz/brick-choir/watch">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://pointcast.xyz/brick-choir/park.webp">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#0b0a1a">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://pointcast.xyz/brick-choir/watch">
<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,500;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Geist+Mono:wght@500;600;700&display=swap">
<style is:inline>
  :root{ --ink:#f4f0ff; --bg:#0b0a1a; --gold:#ffd27a; --pink:#ff8fb1; --mint:#9fe3c9; --sky:#8fd0ff; --lime:#e9ff7a;
    --display:"Bricolage Grotesque","Avenir Next",system-ui,sans-serif; --mono:"Geist Mono",ui-monospace,monospace; color-scheme:dark; }
  html,body{margin:0;min-height:100%;background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font-family:var(--display);}
  body{background:radial-gradient(120% 70% at 50% 110%,rgba(255,143,177,.18),transparent 60%),radial-gradient(90% 60% at 50% -10%,rgba(143,208,255,.14),transparent 60%),var(--bg);}
  main{box-sizing:border-box;width:min(460px,100%);margin:0 auto;padding:calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-top)) 16px calc(28px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom));display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:14px;min-height:100svh;}
  .top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font:600 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase;} .top a{color:var(--sky);text-decoration:none;}
  .logo{display:flex;justify-content:center;font:800 clamp(52px,17vw,76px)/1 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.03em;margin-top:18px;}
  .logo span{background:linear-gradient(180deg,oklch(92% .12 var(--h)),oklch(72% .19 calc(var(--h) + 50)));-webkit-background-clip:text;background-clip:text;color:transparent;}
  .sub{text-align:center;font:800 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.32em;color:var(--gold);text-indent:.32em;}
  p.lead{margin:4px 0 0;text-align:center;font:500 16px/1.45 var(--display);color:rgba(244,240,255,.78);}
  form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;margin-top:10px;}
  label{font:700 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--mint);text-transform:uppercase;}
  input{box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;text-align:center;font:800 44px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.4em;text-indent:.4em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);border:2px solid rgba(255,255,255,.16);border-radius:18px;padding:14px 10px;outline:none;}
  input:focus{border-color:var(--gold);box-shadow:0 0 22px rgba(255,210,122,.25);}
  button{font:800 16px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#140f28;background:var(--gold);border:0;border-radius:999px;padding:16px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 30px rgba(255,210,122,.3);}
  button:disabled{opacity:.35;box-shadow:none;cursor:default;}
  .err{min-height:1.3em;margin:0;text-align:center;font:600 13px var(--mono);color:var(--pink);}
  ul{list-style:none;margin:6px 0 0;padding:0;display:grid;gap:8px;}
  li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:12px;align-items:start;padding:12px 14px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.04);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);font:500 14px/1.4 var(--display);color:rgba(244,240,255,.78);}
  li b{font:800 12px var(--mono);letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--c);padding-top:2px;}
  .fine{margin-top:auto;text-align:center;font:500 12px/1.5 var(--mono);color:rgba(244,240,255,.45);} .fine a{color:var(--sky);}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
  <div class="top"><a href="/brick-choir">← Brick Choir</a><span>Watch mode</span></div>
  <div class="logo" aria-label="Watch"><span style="--h:20">W</span><span style="--h:60">A</span><span style="--h:110">T</span><span style="--h:160">C</span><span style="--h:210">H</span></div>
  <div class="sub">THE MATCH · LIVE</div>
  <p class="lead">Someone's TV is playing Pickle Park or Rally. Type the four-letter code on its screen and you're in the bleachers: hear every hit as a note, and cheer.</p>
  <form id="f" autocomplete="off">
    <label for="code">Room code</label>
    <input id="code" inputmode="text" maxlength="4" placeholder="····" spellcheck="false" autocapitalize="characters" enterkeyhint="go" aria-describedby="err">
    <p class="err" id="err" role="status"></p>
    <button id="go" disabled>Take me to the bleachers</button>
  </form>
  <ul>
    <li style="--c:var(--gold)"><b>SCAN</b><span>Or scan the “Watch on your phone” QR: Pickle Park shows it in the lobby and on the scoreboard, Rally in the TV's top-right corner.</span></li>
    <li style="--c:var(--pink)"><b>SIT</b><span>In Pickle Park your Buddy takes a seat in the bleachers on the TV and waves. Made one on the phone paddle page? It comes along.</span></li>
    <li style="--c:var(--mint)"><b>CHEER</b><span>Clap, “ooh”, start a wave or honk: the crowd on the TV reacts, and a big cheer on a long rally makes it roar.</span></li>
    <li style="--c:var(--sky)"><b>RALLY</b><span>Rally rooms still work: the same link finds the Rally stands on its own.</span></li>
  </ul>
  <p class="fine">Hosting? Open <a href="/brick-choir/park">pointcast.xyz/brick-choir/park</a> (or <a href="/brick-choir/rally">/rally</a>) on a TV. The code is on the screen.</p>
</main>
<script is:inline>
(function(){
  var input=document.getElementById('code'), go=document.getElementById('go'), err=document.getElementById('err');
  function clean(v){ return String(v||'').toUpperCase().replace(/[^A-Z]/g,'').slice(0,4); }
  function open(code){ location.href='/brick-choir/watch/'+code; }
  var q=clean(new URLSearchParams(location.search).get('room')); if(q.length===4){ open(q); return; }
  input.addEventListener('input',function(){ var v=clean(input.value); if(v!==input.value) input.value=v; go.disabled=v.length!==4; err.textContent=''; });
  document.getElementById('f').addEventListener('submit',function(e){ e.preventDefault(); var v=clean(input.value); if(v.length!==4){ err.textContent='Codes are four letters.'; return; } open(v); });
  input.focus();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
